<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais ups call warrants on Wheelock.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais ups call warrants on Wheelock.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it has issued a further 73 million American style call warrants  1743.HK on shares of Wheelock and Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$13.3025     PREMIUM	    11.68 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.68	  GEARING	    2.64X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 23.FEB.98	PAYMENT DATE     01.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     03.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE  HK$18	    MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> NOTES		CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
